{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42127","headline":"从兄龙武将军没於边戍过旧营宅作 · 徐铉","name":"从兄龙武将军没於边戍过旧营宅作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年都尉没边城，帐下何人领旧兵。\n徼外瘴烟沉鼓角，山前秋日照铭旌。\n笙歌却返乌衣巷，部曲皆还细柳营。\n今日园林过寒食，马蹄犹拟入门行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}